{
  "native_artifact_sha256": "acf7089054e8dc6d7953581665afe527b4b950f0426370f8f1d7a02639bb14e4",
  "sdk_segments": [
    {
      "text": "Um, after—",
      "start_ms": 660,
      "end_ms": 1620,
      "speaker": "1",
      "token_start_index": 0,
      "token_end_index": 4
    },
    {
      "text": " Yeah, that's an option too. Hmm, after dinner. Sure.",
      "start_ms": 1740,
      "end_ms": 5700,
      "speaker": "2",
      "token_start_index": 4,
      "token_end_index": 23
    },
    {
      "text": " Today is good, though. Uh, but we have forever. What's your— what would you prefer?",
      "start_ms": 6060,
      "end_ms": 10140,
      "speaker": "1",
      "token_start_index": 23,
      "token_end_index": 54
    },
    {
      "text": " Or 3:30. I just— yeah.",
      "start_ms": 10260,
      "end_ms": 13020,
      "speaker": "2",
      "token_start_index": 54,
      "token_end_index": 65
    },
    {
      "text": " What doesn't matter is your time.",
      "start_ms": 13500,
      "end_ms": 14820,
      "speaker": "1",
      "token_start_index": 65,
      "token_end_index": 77
    },
    {
      "text": " Necessarily.",
      "start_ms": 14880,
      "end_ms": 15240,
      "speaker": "2",
      "token_start_index": 77,
      "token_end_index": 83
    },
    {
      "text": " 3:30 in the— in the computer room in here, and we just—",
      "start_ms": 15480,
      "end_ms": 18180,
      "speaker": "1",
      "token_start_index": 83,
      "token_end_index": 103
    },
    {
      "text": " We just can't get in there, though.",
      "start_ms": 18180,
      "end_ms": 19020,
      "speaker": "2",
      "token_start_index": 103,
      "token_end_index": 115
    },
    {
      "text": " If you can't— can you get in the front door? Oh, you haven't got a key, do you? Can none of you get in?",
      "start_ms": 19380,
      "end_ms": 23700,
      "speaker": "1",
      "token_start_index": 115,
      "token_end_index": 155
    },
    {
      "text": " We— well, we can get in through the— through the—",
      "start_ms": 23760,
      "end_ms": 25800,
      "speaker": "2",
      "token_start_index": 155,
      "token_end_index": 169
    },
    {
      "text": " The— the computer rooms in here, the MSC computer.",
      "start_ms": 25980,
      "end_ms": 28740,
      "speaker": "1",
      "token_start_index": 169,
      "token_end_index": 186
    },
    {
      "text": " I've not found that yet.",
      "start_ms": 28860,
      "end_ms": 29580,
      "speaker": "3",
      "token_start_index": 186,
      "token_end_index": 194
    },
    {
      "text": " Right, it's in here.",
      "start_ms": 29820,
      "end_ms": 30300,
      "speaker": "1",
      "token_start_index": 194,
      "token_end_index": 202
    },
    {
      "text": " How about if we take a—",
      "start_ms": 30300,
      "end_ms": 31020,
      "speaker": "2",
      "token_start_index": 202,
      "token_end_index": 210
    },
    {
      "text": " Or if you find me, I'll show you where— I'll let us all in there, and we can all go in there.",
      "start_ms": 31080,
      "end_ms": 35160,
      "speaker": "1",
      "token_start_index": 210,
      "token_end_index": 244
    },
    {
      "text": " We can look— no, afterwards.",
      "start_ms": 35340,
      "end_ms": 36780,
      "speaker": "3",
      "token_start_index": 244,
      "token_end_index": 254
    },
    {
      "text": " Yeah, yeah, yeah.",
      "start_ms": 37020,
      "end_ms": 37560,
      "speaker": "1",
      "token_start_index": 254,
      "token_end_index": 260
    },
    {
      "text": " Exactly.",
      "start_ms": 37620,
      "end_ms": 37860,
      "speaker": "2",
      "token_start_index": 260,
      "token_end_index": 264
    },
    {
      "text": " Yeah. You do need to have a key for it, though. That's the thing. It's got a locked door, but—",
      "start_ms": 37920,
      "end_ms": 40860,
      "speaker": "1",
      "token_start_index": 264,
      "token_end_index": 297
    },
    {
      "text": " Just bang on it.",
      "start_ms": 41100,
      "end_ms": 42060,
      "speaker": "2",
      "token_start_index": 297,
      "token_end_index": 302
    },
    {
      "text": " Yeah, somebody'll help.",
      "start_ms": 42300,
      "end_ms": 42960,
      "speaker": "1",
      "token_start_index": 302,
      "token_end_index": 311
    },
    {
      "text": " Actually, I was asking Steve about that, whether we can get in there. Whether he was going to get us access into there.",
      "start_ms": 42960,
      "end_ms": 47820,
      "speaker": "2",
      "token_start_index": 311,
      "token_end_index": 348
    },
    {
      "text": " Into what?",
      "start_ms": 48240,
      "end_ms": 48720,
      "speaker": "3",
      "token_start_index": 348,
      "token_end_index": 353
    },
    {
      "text": " The computer room.",
      "start_ms": 48780,
      "end_ms": 49380,
      "speaker": "2",
      "token_start_index": 353,
      "token_end_index": 358
    },
    {
      "text": " Okay.",
      "start_ms": 49560,
      "end_ms": 49800,
      "speaker": "3",
      "token_start_index": 358,
      "token_end_index": 360
    },
    {
      "text": " Yeah. It's only got— it's crap. It's only got about 4 or 5 computers, but it would do quite good for our job, because it can also— it's not very normally with people in it, right?",
      "start_ms": 50460,
      "end_ms": 57780,
      "speaker": "1",
      "token_start_index": 360,
      "token_end_index": 419
    },
    {
      "text": " Right. Is there a printer there too?",
      "start_ms": 58140,
      "end_ms": 59820,
      "speaker": "2",
      "token_start_index": 419,
      "token_end_index": 431
    },
    {
      "text": " Yeah, there's a printer in there. And there's a photocopier. With the code on it, you know?",
      "start_ms": 59880,
      "end_ms": 63900,
      "speaker": "1",
      "token_start_index": 431,
      "token_end_index": 464
    },
    {
      "text": " Yes.",
      "start_ms": 64080,
      "end_ms": 64320,
      "speaker": "2",
      "token_start_index": 464,
      "token_end_index": 466
    },
    {
      "text": " That's good.",
      "start_ms": 64860,
      "end_ms": 65580,
      "speaker": "1",
      "token_start_index": 466,
      "token_end_index": 471
    },
    {
      "text": " That's going to be handy.",
      "start_ms": 65640,
      "end_ms": 66300,
      "speaker": "2",
      "token_start_index": 471,
      "token_end_index": 479
    },
    {
      "text": " Huh. Well, I'm just—",
      "start_ms": 66780,
      "end_ms": 68580,
      "speaker": "3",
      "token_start_index": 479,
      "token_end_index": 489
    },
    {
      "text": " We can photocopy our assignment. If we want to.",
      "start_ms": 68640,
      "end_ms": 72180,
      "speaker": "2",
      "token_start_index": 489,
      "token_end_index": 509
    },
    {
      "text": " We've got it on my computer.",
      "start_ms": 72660,
      "end_ms": 73740,
      "speaker": "3",
      "token_start_index": 509,
      "token_end_index": 519
    },
    {
      "text": " Yeah. All the comments, I'm thinking.",
      "start_ms": 74040,
      "end_ms": 75480,
      "speaker": "2",
      "token_start_index": 519,
      "token_end_index": 532
    },
    {
      "text": " So what time do we say? I just think it's better to do it afterwards, and we have all the time, and—",
      "start_ms": 76080,
      "end_ms": 80940,
      "speaker": "3",
      "token_start_index": 532,
      "token_end_index": 563
    },
    {
      "text": " Yeah, that's true.",
      "start_ms": 80940,
      "end_ms": 81360,
      "speaker": "2",
      "token_start_index": 563,
      "token_end_index": 570
    },
    {
      "text": " So after half an hour, and then we'll actually run out.",
      "start_ms": 81360,
      "end_ms": 84300,
      "speaker": "3",
      "token_start_index": 570,
      "token_end_index": 588
    },
    {
      "text": " Yeah.",
      "start_ms": 84300,
      "end_ms": 84480,
      "speaker": "2",
      "token_start_index": 588,
      "token_end_index": 590
    },
    {
      "text": " Yeah. Yeah. Okay.",
      "start_ms": 84480,
      "end_ms": 87720,
      "speaker": "3",
      "token_start_index": 590,
      "token_end_index": 596
    },
    {
      "text": " As long as the analogy doesn't go late.",
      "start_ms": 88800,
      "end_ms": 90480,
      "speaker": "2",
      "token_start_index": 596,
      "token_end_index": 608
    },
    {
      "text": " Hopefully it's not that man, so it won't matter.",
      "start_ms": 91860,
      "end_ms": 93480,
      "speaker": "1",
      "token_start_index": 608,
      "token_end_index": 625
    },
    {
      "text": " Actually, it's not even confirmed yet.",
      "start_ms": 96300,
      "end_ms": 97980,
      "speaker": "3",
      "token_start_index": 625,
      "token_end_index": 638
    },
    {
      "text": " What?",
      "start_ms": 98820,
      "end_ms": 99060,
      "speaker": "1",
      "token_start_index": 638,
      "token_end_index": 641
    },
    {
      "text": " Oh.",
      "start_ms": 99240,
      "end_ms": 99420,
      "speaker": "2",
      "token_start_index": 641,
      "token_end_index": 643
    },
    {
      "text": " She doesn't even know what she's talking about. Maybe it doesn't happen at all.",
      "start_ms": 99660,
      "end_ms": 104100,
      "speaker": "3",
      "token_start_index": 643,
      "token_end_index": 671
    },
    {
      "text": " Sounds like me.",
      "start_ms": 105300,
      "end_ms": 105780,
      "speaker": "2",
      "token_start_index": 671,
      "token_end_index": 677
    },
    {
      "text": " It's really weird this week. It should be— is it really?",
      "start_ms": 105900,
      "end_ms": 108300,
      "speaker": "3",
      "token_start_index": 677,
      "token_end_index": 696
    },
    {
      "text": " Really?",
      "start_ms": 108600,
      "end_ms": 108900,
      "speaker": "2",
      "token_start_index": 696,
      "token_end_index": 699
    },
    {
      "text": " What? It's supposed to be.",
      "start_ms": 109200,
      "end_ms": 110160,
      "speaker": "3",
      "token_start_index": 699,
      "token_end_index": 710
    },
    {
      "text": " A weekend.",
      "start_ms": 110220,
      "end_ms": 110760,
      "speaker": "2",
      "token_start_index": 710,
      "token_end_index": 715
    },
    {
      "text": " Next week. It's week 6 next week.",
      "start_ms": 111300,
      "end_ms": 113220,
      "speaker": "3",
      "token_start_index": 715,
      "token_end_index": 728
    },
    {
      "text": " Really? Oh.",
      "start_ms": 113340,
      "end_ms": 114060,
      "speaker": "2",
      "token_start_index": 728,
      "token_end_index": 733
    },
    {
      "text": " I don't think we have a reading week, though. I don't know. We have one class, at least, when we speech perception. We don't have any lectures. ",
      "start_ms": 114180,
      "end_ms": 119640,
      "speaker": "3",
      "token_start_index": 733,
      "token_end_index": 781
    }
  ],
